{
  "name": "sharewithagent",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "description": "Visual feedback your coding agent can act on — capture any web page, point at elements, and hand your agent element-anchored comments (CSS selector + bounding box + element HTML + computed styles), not \"something near (840, 312).\"",
